                        "review": "The controls are intuitive, the filesize is good, and the overall idea is fantastic, but since the per-map strategies are basically solved (40 consecutive wins if you draw out the sightlines on the maps & send your snipers there as fast as you possibly can, interception paths known after you've spawned from them in previous rounds because spawns don't change), a procedural map generator (or at least something that maybe rotates the map pieces and spawn points) would take it from being good but repetitive to unpredictable and perfect!\nIt certainly is special and tactics and online.",
